:: Sister Hallway Bump [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1550,2900","size":"100,100"}
/* Slapstick: she is carrying something, you nearly collide. Catch it, help, or joke. */
<<silently>>
<<set _item to either("a stack of textbooks", "a basket of laundry", "a pizza box", "three coffees in a cardboard tray")>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $sister, text: "Whoa! Watch it!" }
]>>
<</silently>>
<p>I turn the corner and almost walk straight into $sister.callName. She's carrying <<= _item>> and has no free hand to stop me.</p>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<div id="choice1">
	<div>
		<<link "Catch it">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<if random(1, 100) <= 60>>
					<<silently>>
					<<set _msgs to [
						{ text: "I get one hand under it just in time." },
						{ who: $sister, text: "Reflexes. Nice. Who are you and what did you do with my clumsy $sister.playerRelation?" }
					]>>
					<</silently>>
					<<Chat _msgs>>
					<br>
					<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 2>>
				<<else>>
					<<silently>>
					<<set _msgs to [
						{ text: "I miss completely and everything hits the floor." },
						{ who: $sister, text: "Great. Now we both get to clean that up." },
						{ who: $player, text: "You walked into me." },
						{ who: $sister, text: "In my own hallway!" }
					]>>
					<</silently>>
					<<Chat _msgs>>
				<</if>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Help her carry it">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Here, let me take half." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Thanks. That was the least you could do." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Make a joke about it">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "You walk like someone who wants to get yelled at." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Says the guy who walks like a zombie." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
